{"content":[{"c":["ELIEZER"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":[" 1. Native of Damascus and Abraham’s servant, who according to custom was the adopted heir before Ishmael and Isaac were born (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.15.2","r":"Gen.15.2","rawR":"Gen.15.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.15.2","value":"Gen.15.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 15:2"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 2. Moses and Zipporah’s second son (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.18.4","r":"Exod.18.4","rawR":"Exod.18.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.18.4","value":"Exod.18.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 18:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.23.15-17","r":"1Chr.23.15-17","rawR":"1Chr.23.15-17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.23.15-17","value":"1Chr.23.15-17"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 23:15-17"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 3. Benjamite and Becher’s son (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.8","r":"1Chr.7.8","rawR":"1Chr.7.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.8","value":"1Chr.7.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 4. One of the seven priests who blew a trumpet before the ark of the covenant when David moved it to Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.15.24","r":"1Chr.15.24","rawR":"1Chr.15.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.15.24","value":"1Chr.15.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 15:24"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 5. Zichri’s son and a chief officer in Reuben’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.16","r":"1Chr.27.16","rawR":"1Chr.27.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.16","value":"1Chr.27.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 6. Son of Dodavahu of Mareshah, who prophesied against King Jehoshaphat of Judah because of his alliance with Ahaziah, king of Israel (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.20.37","r":"2Chr.20.37","rawR":"2Chr.20.37","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.20.37","value":"2Chr.20.37"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 20:37"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 7. One of the leaders sent by Ezra to Iddo at Casiphia to request Levites for the house of God (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.16","r":"Ezra.8.16","rawR":"Ezra.8.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.16","value":"Ezra.8.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 8, 9, 10. Three men of Israel—a priest, Levite, and Israelite—who were encouraged by Ezra to divorce their foreign wives during the postexilic era (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.18,23,31","r":"Ezra.10.18,23,31","rawR":"Ezra.10.18,23,31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.18,23,31","value":"Ezra.10.18,23,31"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:18, 23, 31"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["11. Ancestor of Christ (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.3.29","r":"Luke.3.29","rawR":"Luke.3.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.3.29","value":"Luke.3.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 3:29"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Genealogy of Jesus Christ"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Eliezer","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 15:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.15.2","rawQueryValue":"Gen.15.2","sourceRefExact":"Gen.15.2"},{"anchorText":"Ex 18:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.18.4","rawQueryValue":"Exod.18.4","sourceRefExact":"Exod.18.4"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 23:15-17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.23.15-17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.23.15-17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.23.15-17"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.8","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.8","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.8"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 15:24","canonicalization":